{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101340","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101340","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310134001:0":{"text":"なんとか片付いたな……","source_cn":"总算将它们处理完了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DA03E0F6A2D5B44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310134002:0":{"text":"メイジ<male>殿</male><female>殿</female>、君の使い魔と仲間の実力は間違いなく本物だ。","source_cn":"魔法师<male>先生</male><female>女...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x82C494781D3D40DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"メイジ<male>殿</male><female>殿</female>、君の使い魔と仲間の実力は間違いなく本物だ。","female":"メイジ<male>殿</male><female>殿</female>、君の使い魔と仲間の実力は間違いなく本物だ。","variant_male_record_index":"143032","variant_female_record_index":"143033","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310134003:0":{"text":"協力に感謝する。君たちの力を疑ってすまなかった、今までの無礼を許してほしい。","source_cn":"感谢诸位的援助，我不该怀疑你们的能力，请允许我为我之前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A2FA032CCAC1006","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310134004:0":{"text":"気にしないでください！ロンロンたちの安全を心配してのことですし……","source_cn":"哎呀，不必这样，你也是为了我们的安全考虑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8237FFF317AE579E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310134005:0":{"text":"生きた屍が祭典に害をなさないよう、スノーシダー町周辺の安全を守るのが私の役目だというのに……","source_cn":"我本应负责雪松镇周边的安全，以应对可能会对祭典造成破坏...","status":"matc